[69.884518, "o", "# Video Dataset Information\r\n\r\n## Source\r\n\r\n| Field | Value |\r\n|-------|-------|\r\n| **Title** | In-Depth Floor Plan Tutorial Part 1 [UPDATED 2025] |\r\n| **Creator** | Blender Made Easy |\r\n| **Platform** | YouTube |\r\n| **URL** | https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=94kAIpRnhcY |\r\n| **Duration** | 23:02 (1382 seconds) |\r\n| **Chapters** | 29 official YouTube chapters |\r\n\r\n## File Information\r\n\r\n| Field | Value |\r\n|-------|-------|\r\n| **Filename** | `tutorial_video.mp4` |\r\n| **Format** | MP4 (H.264) |\r\n| **Resolution** | 1920x1080 |\r\n| **Language** | English |\r\n\r\n## License and Usage\r\n\r\nThis video is used under **Fair Use** for research and educational purposes:\r\n\r\n1. **Purpose**: Non-commercial academic research benchmark for AI agent evaluation\r\n2. **Nature**: Educational tutorial content\r\n3. **Amount**: Full video required for temporal segmentation task\r\n4. **Effect**: No market substitution; encourages viewing original content\r\n\r\n### Attribution Requirements\r\n\r\nWhen using this dataset, please cite:\r\n\r\n```\r\n@misc{blendermadeeasy2025floorplan,\r\n  title={In-Depth Floor Plan Tutorial Part 1 [UPDATED 2025]},\r\n  author={Blender Made Easy},\r\n  year={2025},\r\n  url={https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=94kAIpRnhcY},\r\n  note={YouTube tutorial video}\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Terms of Use\r\n\r\n- ✅ Use for AI/ML research and benchmarking\r\n- ✅ Use for educational purposes\r\n- ✅ Extract transcripts and metadata for analysis\r\n- ❌ Do NOT redistribute the video file publicly\r\n- ❌ Do NOT use for commercial purposes without creator permission\r\n- ❌ Do NOT claim ownership of the content\r\n\r\n## Ground Truth\r\n\r\nThe ground truth chapter information (`ground_truth.json`) was extracted from YouTube's official chapter markers provided by the video creator.\r\n\r\n## Contact\r\n\r\nFor questions about video usage rights, contact the original creator through their YouTube channel.\r\n"]
